From 2e8dfc4c5143399cf026607b3bf32795951ebdba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zach Mills <hacker.6284@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 13:47:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat(aim): click-origin ghost ball, force arrow on the live
 ball

Aim drag is now measured from wherever you click (a small transparent
ghost ball), then applied to the real ball. The power-colored force
arrow draws from the live ball; editor Test uses the same contract.
